        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI 444-610-P22, 24\" Rectangular Black Stainless Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 24 Inch Rectangular Black Stainless Steel Door Handle features a rich, powder coat matte black finish paired with the modern silhouette that is trending in the design world. What is more, the Matte Black Stainless Steel 2 Foot Rectangular Door Pull is ADA compliant, meaning that it can be used in commercial applications as well as residential settings. This versatile pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back-to-back mounting (just order 2 pulls if you and them back-to-back) for wood, fiberglass, glass, and metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-444-610-specifications.gif?v=1704442292\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"24 Inch Rectangle Door Pull dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Matte Black 24 Inch Rectangle Stainless Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/8\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 14-3/8\" (365 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\" (64 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rectangle Handle Diameter: 1-3/8\" x 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Post Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-444-610-specifications.pdf?v=1691093347\"><b>AHI 444-610 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Matte Black Stainless Steel 2 Foot Rectangular Door Pull",
                "description": "This 24 Inch Rectangular Black Stainless Steel Door Handle features a rich, powder coat matte black finish paired with the modern silhouette that is trending in the design world. What is more, the Matte Black Stainless Steel 2 Foot Rectangular Door Pull is ADA compliant, meaning that it can be used in commercial applications as well as residential settings. This versatile pull is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back-to-back mounting (just order 2 pulls if you and them back-to-back) for wood, fiberglass, glass, and metal doors.",
                "keywords": "AHI 444-610-P22, Matte Black Stainless Steel 2 Foot Rectangular Door Pulls, 24 Inch Rectangular Matte Black Door Pulls, AHI-444-610-P22, 24 inch Rectangular Black Stainless Steel Door Handles, Matte Black 24 Inch Rectangle Stainless Door Handles,"
